2862364257246355", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031514_2862364260579688_306087352317523359_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Qk1xFrT3BoQ7kNvwHMxYpG&_nc_oc=Adp94H3KYwIOCIzwHvWXQEMQQUSVL5f-IO23c03IOUTEk2RpmAkPxcIXiaomqTIjizA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3ms_iVoMk9ydsmih1qcqqiU4QwQd5cHo4gbb5JypPGWA&oe=69D3A140"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer COver.png", "id": "1288041185499986", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_1288041188833319_1651999487860440247_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5EPpVpnpbnQQ7kNvwFYAtQn&_nc_oc=Adp_AOpK5b2CId3ZYZG9AIJ2UHgP7quauPJitAjkT72bJmKvH-kCmcr4RYHSdFM71EI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af34t5DiCo2w0sNbjXnRI0p9-yN1xIAHPQhnkmKIGUWFqg&oe=69D3A411"}, "display_name": "TinyFins", "keywords": ["cute", "highscore", "underwater", "fish", "mixedreality"], "long_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!\n\nFeatures include:\n- Shark, pufferfish and squid enemies\n- Highscore system with the ability to unlock ranks and trophies\n- Intuitive, flowy controls\n- Collecting fish of different colors", "short_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They